## ZPE-Prosody — speech/prosody codec with CPU retrieval

### (i) Rescue-retrieval vs narrow-the-lane verdict

**Verdict: narrow the lane.** The p@5=0.80 gate was set before the 2024 speech-tokenization revolution. Mimi (Kyutai, Défossez et al., arXiv:2410.00037) now distils WavLM semantics into the first RVQ codebook at 12.5 Hz / 1.1 kbps, and SpiRit-LM (Nguyen et al., TACL 2025, arXiv:2402.05755) models pitch + style as tokens *inside* a unified speech-text LM. In that world, a bespoke "prosody-only retrieval index" is architecturally obsolete — downstream users will query the semantic token space or WavLM embeddings directly. ZPE-Prosody's F0 RMSE 0.8925% and 16.6× compression are genuinely competitive artifacts; **they just aren't retrieval artifacts**.

### (ii) Strongest current wedge if narrowed

**Streaming prosody-aware codec + emotion/SER retrieval as the *service*, not the *gate*.** Narrow to (a) streaming Mimi-compatible codec with explicit prosody subspace à la FACodec (Ju et al., NaturalSpeech 3, ICML 2024, arXiv:2403.03100), and (b) retrieval keyed on emotion2vec+ distilled embeddings benchmarked on IEMOCAP + MSP-Podcast + Expresso + SD-Eval (NeurIPS 2024 D&B). This gives the lane an honest, defensible, measured SOTA-comparable posture.

### (iii) Best CPU-first rescue path if retrieval stays

If the business case forces retrieval-as-gate to stay, the CPU-first rescue is unambiguous: **XEUS layer-19 embeddings (Chen et al., EMNLP 2024 Best Paper, arXiv:2407.00837) k-means bucketed → RaBitQ 1-bit re-rank** (Gao & Long, SIGMOD 2024, arXiv:2405.12497), with SOAR spilling (Sun et al., NeurIPS 2023, arXiv:2404.00774). Elastic BBQ and Milvus 2.6 have shown ~3.6× QPS over FP32 at equivalent recall; this is the current CPU frontier. Expected p@5 on semantic-level retrieval: break the 0.80 gate comfortably. LoRANN (Vecchiato et al., NeurIPS 2024) is the alternative if supervised IVF is needed.

### (iv) Most credible grant/commercial framing

**Commercial:** streaming emotion-aware speech codec for call-center analytics (Cresta, Observe.AI, Uniphore), conversational AI (Kyutai/Moshi-style deployments), and multilingual TTS (ElevenLabs, Suno). **Grant:** IndiaAI Foundation Models CFP — Indian-language prosody is an explicit national priority with multi-crore budgets; AI Singapore's S$150M NAIRD pool; EIC Pathfinder Challenge **DeepRAP** (28 Oct 2026) for reasoning over speech tokens. US: NSF SBIR Phase I for commercial track; DARPA AIE rolling opportunities for speech-foundation thrusts.

### (v) Ranked 3-step action plan with stop rule

1. **Narrow the lane publicly: retire the p@5=0.80 gate; replace with streaming prosody-codec + emotion-retrieval KPI on IEMOCAP/MSP-Podcast** (L, ~2 eng-weeks). Stop if emotion2vec+ adapter cannot hit baseline within 3 weeks.
2. **Ship Mimi-compatible RVQ head with explicit 3.1 Hz prosody branch following SNAC multi-scale design** (M, ~10 eng-weeks).
3. **If retrieval stays as a ship target, build XEUS + RaBitQ-SOAR CPU retrieval pipeline as the honest baseline** (M, ~6 eng-weeks).

**Stop rule:** if after narrowing + emotion2vec+ distillation the lane cannot publicly demonstrate SOTA-competitive MCD / MUSHRA numbers on Expresso by end-Q3 2026, park and redirect capacity.

### (vi) NeurIPS 2024/25 citations

- **Mimi** (Défossez et al., arXiv:2410.00037, Kyutai) — 12.5 Hz streaming prosody-aware codec, de-facto frontier.
- **WavTokenizer** (Ji et al., ICLR 2025, arXiv:2408.16532, OpenReview yBlVlS2Fd9) — extreme single-codebook compression baseline.
- **UniAudio 1.5 / LLM-Codec** (Yang et al., NeurIPS 2024) — codec-to-LLM token alignment; retrieval moves into LM space.
- **SD-Eval** (NeurIPS 2024 D&B) — benchmark beyond-words speech dialog evaluation.
- **RaBitQ** (Gao & Long, SIGMOD 2024, arXiv:2405.12497) — CPU ANN frontier; adopted by Elastic BBQ.

### Re-scope argument

The p@5=0.80 gate is not a sovereign constraint — it is a **1-year-obsolete retrieval KPI** now obviated by Mimi/SpiRit-LM's absorption of prosody into unified token streams. Continuing to treat it as sovereign is an epistemic mistake; re-scope to emotion-retrieval + streaming codec.

### Engineering augmentation

**Build:** `prosody-rvq-mimi-compat` — a Mimi-wire-compatible encoder with a prosody subspace codebook (FACodec factorization) and an emotion2vec+-distilled retrieval head. **Why:** unlocks IndiaAI Indian-language prosody grant track; directly productizable with Kyutai ecosystem. **Complexity:** M (~12 eng-weeks).

