## ZPE-IoT — IoT sensor stream codec

### (i) Best single bounded closure lane

**DS-12 closure via TTM-r2 residual prior + Gorilla-XOR fallback.** DS-12 is the sole competitor-win in the 10/11 benchmark — it is the single highest-leverage closure because it turns a public 10/11 into an honest 11/11 while consuming <15 engineer-weeks. Adopting Tiny Time Mixers-r2 (Ekambaram et al., NeurIPS 2024, arXiv:2401.03955; HF ibm-granite/granite-timeseries-ttm-r2, 1–5M params, Apache license) as a residual predictor, with Gorilla-XOR as the entropy-fallback when residual entropy exceeds threshold, covers the known failure mode cleanly.

