1. **Ship integer-canvas ink tokenizer library with fuzz-tested cross-runtime determinism (Py/Rust/Swift/C#)** (L-M, ~6 eng-weeks). Kill if any runtime pair cannot achieve byte-identical round-trip after 4 weeks.
